<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>癫症 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%99%AB%E7%97%87/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 09:27:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%99%AB%E7%97%87/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>狂症</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-13-kuangzhen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 09:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-13-kuangzhen/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“狂症”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;狂病&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则，区分伤寒发狂与内伤终年狂病两种类型。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;伤寒发狂属阳明热盛，当以白虎汤泻火；内伤久狂乃心气之虚，热邪痰气乘之，不可泻火消痰，而当补脾胃以养心，使心气得养则火自息、痰自化&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>癫症</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-12-dianzhen/</link><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 14:51:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-12-dianzhen/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“癫症”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;癫病&lt;/strong&gt;与&lt;strong&gt;花癫&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;癫症多生于脾胃虚寒，水谷不化精微而生痰，痰迷心窍则癫。治当温补脾胃以绝生痰之源，佐以化痰开窍，不可徒治其痰。花癫乃女子思慕所致，兼肝郁化火，须加疏肝清热之品&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>